  {
    "id": "anno-tsushima_upper_p017_right-10",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但本藩兩關所詰役員給米且筆墨紙始年中諸入費且同所諸公役召"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、本藩両関所詰の役員給米、且つ筆・墨・紙をはじめ年中諸入費、且つ同所諸公役召…／ただし、ほんぱんりょうせきしょづめのやくいんきゅうまい、かつふで・すみ・かみをはじめねんじゅうしょにゅうひ、かつどうしょしょこうやくめし…"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: [this covers] salary-rice for the officials stationed at the domain's two checkpoints, plus year-round sundry expenses beginning with brush, ink and paper, and public-duty levies at the same place… (explanatory note)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "note_two_checkpoints_officials"
